{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261018/photo/bkn-20261018111318599-1018_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261018114749\"/><p>現場為一間百佳超級市場。</p><p>香港仔發生火警。今晨(18日)11時03分，途人報案，指香港仔中心一間百佳超級市場有爐頭起火並冒出濃煙。救援人員接報到場，發現火勢已熄滅只餘下些許濃煙，事件中無人受傷毋須疏散，起火原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T03:58:42.566260+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:13:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T06:57:43.853834+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T03:57:42.362988+00:00","content_hash":"6f054a1898a8e523532c1b03de7afb01a97f17e9718ef0c866df1bd4c7522cec","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}